ng kills without dying unlocks powerful rewards like UAVs (shows enemy locations on the radar), Cruise Missiles, and attack helicopters that will automatically or manually secure more kills for you.\n\n### 4. Strategy and Map Awareness\n* **Watch the Minimap:** Look for red dots (unsilenced enemy fire) and listen for footsteps to pinpoint where the enemy is before you engage.\n* **Use Cover:** Never sprint out in the open. Move from cover to cover so that if you take fire, you can duck away and heal before re-engaging.\n* **Reload Safely:** Don't reload immediately after every kill if you still have half a magazine left. Wait until you are behind cover, as enemies often travel in pairs.",
